    "reported_claims": [
      "A rigorous and tight lower bound on the thermodynamic ground-state energy.",
      "An optimized reduced density matrix rho_W_star on a spatial window.",
      "For sufficiently tight bounds, the window RDM reproduces known model-state RDMs with reported fidelity comparisons.",
      "For Laughlin and Moore-Read parent Hamiltonians, pair correlations and orbital entanglement spectra are reproduced.",
      "For projected Coulomb interactions, the paper reports recovery of nu=1/3 Laughlin, nu=5/2 Moore-Read and nu=1/2 composite Fermi liquid diagnostics.",
      "The paper reports a nu=1/4 composite-Fermi-liquid interpretation from OES and real-space correlations.",
      "The paper reports a nu=12/5 anti-Read-Rezayi_3 interpretation from combined diagnostics."
    ],
    "intake_status": "abstract_reviewed_full_method_and_ancillary_source_intake_pending",
