      "Exact geometry and gauge conventions.",
      "Window shape, size and boundary assumptions.",
      "Bootstrap hierarchy, moment/RDM constraints and truncation.",
      "Objective functional and rigorous thermodynamic-limit argument.",
      "Optimizer settings, primal/dual residuals and exactness/rounding policy.",
      "Observable definitions, OES cut, symmetry sectors and phase diagnostic thresholds."
    ]
